{"unit_id":"kaijia323__dsh-plugin-jev#card-zh","repo":"kaijia323/dsh-plugin-jev","commit":"aabaff44df0532b3d5a0bb224402ba8ba50b3051","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-jev 将 TypeSafe Jev System One 决策模型接入 DSH，注册原生 jev_decide 工具并可选加入常驻决策提示。它把 state 和类型化问题发送到 TypeSafe 官方接口，返回分类、评分或是非判断及置信度。适合需要结构化判断、路由和置信度门控的 DSH agent。需要 TypeSafe API key，可从环境变量或本地密钥文件读取。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:659-684","lib/index.js:373-421"]}
